# Task 5: Repoint selector.nix + add guardrails

## Changes Made

### tests/selector.nix
- Added `profiles = import ../profiles.nix;` binding
- Repointed `duplicateWithinCommonSelector` fixtures:
  - `../skills/common-general/caveman` → `../.agents/skills/caveman`
  - `../skills/common-personal/svelte` → `../.agents/skills/svelte`
- Repointed `harnessOverrideSelector` fixtures:
  - `../skills/common-general/caveman` → `../.agents/skills/caveman` (5 occurrences)
  - `../skills/claude-code-general/skill-creator` → `../.claude/skills/skill-creator`
- Repointed path match asserts:
  - `.*/skills/common-general/mcp-builder` → `.*/.agents/skills/mcp-builder`
  - `.*/skills/claude-code-general/skill-creator` → `.*/.claude/skills/skill-creator` (2 occurrences)
- Added 3 guardrail asserts:
  - (i) profiles.personal ∩ profiles.work == []
  - (ii) every profile name resolves to a dir with SKILL.md
  - (iii) personal names in commonPersonal not commonWork, vice versa; 77 general

